    _vocab("Group 35", 10, "Innately", "Adverb", "Naturally from birth, rather than through learning.", "শেখার মাধ্যমে নয়, জন্মগতভাবে", "Babies are innately curious.", "শিশুরা জন্মগতভাবে কৌতূহলী।"),
